Upstream sources
----------------

The patches apply to the upstream releases pinned in dockerfiles/Dockerfile
(the FROM line) and dockerfiles/Dockerfile.element (ELEMENT_WEB_TAG). The
images are built on those releases, and their source is not part of this
repository:

    Synapse       https://github.com/element-hq/synapse
    Element Web   https://github.com/element-hq/element-web

Upstream pull requests that a patch backports or mirrors:

    patches/synapse/msc4133-profile-field-write-policy.patch
        https://github.com/element-hq/synapse/pull/19980
    patches/element-web/browser-eventindex.patch
        https://github.com/element-hq/element-web/pull/34718
    patches/element-web/sw-versions-no-cache-on-error.patch
        https://github.com/element-hq/element-web/pull/35242

Container images built from this repository contain these upstream
programs and other third-party software, each under its own license.
